.. image:: img/ws2812b-8x8.gif
   :align: right
   :alt: Waveshare RP2350-Matrix WS2812 LED Test Pattern

.. rubric:: WS2812 LED Test Pattern by PIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`led-strip`.

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/led/led_strip
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2350_matrix
      :board: waveshare_rp2350_matrix/rp2350a/m33
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/led/led_strip
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2350_matrix
      :board: waveshare_rp2350_matrix/rp2350a/hazard3
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

.. hint::

   Neither LED Blinky nor LED Fade can be built and executed on this
   board, because this system has only a digital RGB LED strip.
   A simple GPIO or PWM control is not possible!
